    "reviews": "\u201cIt's not your average holiday game... and that's a good thing.\u201d<br>8-Bit Central<br><br>\u201cHilarious! Santa is doing just what we would really love to do to our worst enemies. The music just makes it all that much more fun!\u201d<br>Larry Browne Jr<br><br>\u201cRetro action gaming + Santa pooping = awesome Fun, irreverent holiday action that will keep you laughing, cursing, and pooping into the new year. Download immediately.\u201d<br>John Harris<br>",
